  "release_changes": "## 🚀 Features\n\n- feat(viewer): restyle session detail sections (#1358)\n- feat(action): opt-in resolution of the bot's own outdated review threads (#567) (#944)\n- feat(viewer): integrate a shared SVG icon set (#1367)\n- feat(viewer): align design-token values to the mockup palette (#1365)\n- feat(plugin): add kimi code plugin (#1355)\n- feat(pages): standardize web crawler policy (#939)\n- feat(viewer): restyle the session compare page (#1328) (#1331)\n- feat(viewer): restyle Coverage and Token Usage cards (#1346)\n- feat(viewer): add shared design foundation (#1338)\n- feat(viewer): align suggested change indentation with existing code gutter (#1313) (#1315)\n\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n- fix(agent): enforce --max-tokens-budget inside a running group (#1248)\n- fix: dedupe overlapping incremental review comments (#1359)\n- fix(install): add download timeout to asset fetch in install.sh (#1292)\n- fix(tool): enforce the global code search result limit (#1306)\n- fix(session): tolerate truncated resume tail (#1312)\n- fix(diff): strip trailing CR from CRLF diff text (#1302)\n\n## 📖 Documentation\n\n- docs(skill): skip ocr install pre-check on the common path (#1356)\n- docs(telemetry): document existing LLM and tool spans (#1348)\n\n## Other Changes\n\n- chore(pages): remove MacPorts install channel (#1334)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review/compare/v1.12.4...v1.12.5",
